  m_Text: 'Visible Across Scenes

    Make use of Keep Across Scenes which works

    different
    than Remember Home Scene

    (see online docs for a comparison)

    Ensure
    the scenes are added to the Scene List. To do this, navigate to

    File > Build
    Profiles > Scene List and include the following demo scenes:


    PersistentObjectsScene1

    PersistentObjectsScene2


    Verify
    that the Visibility Settings for the Sphere GameObjects are

    correctly configured
    to make them visible in these scenes.'
